      "message": "The syv682 smart discharge only works when the voltage is below 3.5V(\u003c vSinkDisconnect 3.67V), so if the FRS hub has a bigger capacitor, this might potentially violate the tSinkDisconnect. We had tested on some FRS hubs on hayato, some worked, but some didn\u0027t.\n\nthe previous issue: https://issuetracker.google.com/181203590#comment20",
